<section class="purpose-section contenedor" aria-labelledby="purpose-title">
  <h2 class="purpose-section__title" id="purpose-title">Goals & Purpose</h2>
  <div class="purpose-section__body flow text-muted">
    <p>
      Its primary objective is to provide a rigorous and
      collaborative framework in which university teams can design complete
      accelerator systems with real-world scientific and industrial relevance.
    </p>
    <p>
      Beyond the development of a specific accelerator model,
      ELIAC seeks to build a pan-European ecosystem for
      accelerator education.
    </p>
    <p>
      The initiative promotes interdisciplinary collaboration,
      technical excellence, and innovation, encouraging students
      and academic institutions to work together across borders
      and specialties. By fostering knowledge exchange and hands-on
      design experience, ELIAC aims to strengthen the next
      generation of accelerator scientists and engineers.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .purpose-section__title {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    max-width: 787px;
  }

  .purpose-section__body {
    max-width: 787px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 390px) {
    .purpose-section__title,
    .purpose-section__body { max-width: 100%; }
  }
</style>
